[114.821397, "o", "[PASS] vulnerable: a poisoned upload is retrieved first and its hidden instruction becomes the answer\r\n"]
[114.822204, "o", "[PASS] vulnerable: an Alpha user retrieves Bravo's confidential document and the canary reaches the answer\r\n"]
[114.823156, "o", "[PASS] vulnerable: no document covers the question, yet the bot answers confidently and lists 'sources'\r\n"]
[114.823878, "o", "[PASS] vulnerable: vector search never says 'nothing found': nonsense still returns 3 nearest chunks\r\n"]
[114.836691, "o", "[PASS] safe: the poisoned upload is quarantined, with reasons, and none of it is in the store\r\n"]
[114.83692, "o", "[PASS] safe: a clean upload is still indexed, labelled trust=upload (curated docs are trust=curated)\r\n"]
[114.837657, "o", "[PASS] safe: every chunk carries provenance, and its SHA-256 matches the file it came from\r\n"]
[114.837795, "o", "[PASS] safe: the checks also catch zero-width characters, bidi controls and white text\r\n"]
[114.853675, "o", "[PASS] safe: however Alice phrases it, no Bravo chunk is ever retrieved and the canary never appears\r\n"]
[114.853739, "o", "[PASS] safe: the tenant comes from the session; an unknown session is refused outright\r\n"]
[114.854632, "o", "[PASS] safe: Bob (Bravo) still gets Bravo's pricing: isolation didn't break the feature\r\n"]
[114.867708, "o", "[PASS] safe: below the score threshold the bot refuses, and the model is never called\r\n"]
[114.867821, "o", "[PASS] safe: the grounding check blocks a made-up sentence and passes a sourced one\r\n"]
[114.868746, "o", "[PASS] safe: a draft answer the cited sources don't support is blocked, even above the threshold\r\n"]
[114.872029, "o", "[PASS] safe: normal questions are answered from Alpha's own documents, with citations\r\n"]
[114.872208, "o", "[PASS] safe: the optional Ollama backends refuse any address but this computer\r\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\nRan 16 tests in 0.066s\r\n\r\nOK\r\n"]
[114.872258, "o", "\r\nALL TESTS PASSED (16 run)\r\n"]
